WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
<b>Live action Gintama!!</b>

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.980
<b>Take two!!</b>

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:36.140
<b>Odd Jobs Gin
Snack Otose</b>

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.750
Oh, wow...

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.410
It looks so real.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:13.980
I know.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.370
The hell it does!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.870
This is way crappier than the first take!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.120
Everybody saw this coming.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.810
The staff went overboard 
with that Kaien crap,

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:23.240
so we're out of money.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.460
It was pretty expensive 
to borrow the mannequins

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.280
we used in the last live-action segment.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.410
Nobody wants to hear about that!

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:30.630
So what do we do now?

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.450
We already opened with the punch line.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:34.360
Huh? We still have that.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.140
When we're out of punch 
lines, there's always that.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:14.980
<b>A Shinsengumi vacation will 
never go off without a hitch!!</b>

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:20.030
<b>Everyone meets up at the ski slopes!! And 
there's someone else along for the ride...</b>

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:25.700
Huh? A vacation?

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:30.170
Yeah, it's so cold that those 
terrorists are probably hibernating.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:35.050
Matsudaira said that we should 
go on a ski trip to boost morale.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.260
Where did he get that idea?

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.430
We can't go on a pleasure trip 
and leave Edo undefended.

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:44.450
Besides, that freak is always 
telling us to work harder.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:45.930
Something isn't right.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.840
You're being paranoid.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:52.180
We've been working without any rest 
since the show started up again.

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.020
I guess a person who's rotten to the core

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.690
doesn't know how to accept 
a gesture of kindness.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:59.450
I don't need to hear that from 
someone who's rotten to his soul.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:01.380
If you're worried about Edo,

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.700
we can divide the men into the 
Kondo team and the Hijikata team

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.700
and have one team stay behind.

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:09.110
I'm sure you can defend Edo 
by yourself, Hijikata-san.

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:11.100
Why is Hijikata-san the only 
person on the Hijikata team?

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.460
Why is he the one staying behind?

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:13.850
Let's go.

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:15.870
Even gorillas need to hibernate.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:17.460
I'm not a gorilla.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:20.770
K-Kondo-san!

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.390
If you don't want to hibernate, 
I'll just terminate you.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:27.990
A beast can't survive winter if he 
doesn't know when to rest his fangs.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:29.640
P-Pops!

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.770
It wouldn't matter if you 
were a solitary gorilla,

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.520
but you're a gorilla who leads a whole troop.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.900
Th-That was close!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.480
One bad decision and your entire 
troop will be buried under the snow.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.590
But if you insist on continuing 
with your cracked fangs,

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.790
I'm going to

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.380
snap them off.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.540
Do you want to go to sleep and see tomorrow?

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.590
Or go to sleep and never wake up again?

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:51.990
Make your choice.

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:54.580
If you don't make a choice in three 
seconds, I'll blow your head off.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.920
One...

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:57.860
What happened to two and three?!

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:59.340
Never heard of those numbers before.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:03.050
A man only needs to know the number 
one to get along in this world.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.150
Hey, Toshi. What about you?

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:07.200
Are you going to rest or die?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.390
Make it quick!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.130
I'm staying behind.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.980
We need someone to take Kondo-san's place.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:13.320
Absolutely not.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:14.060
You're going with him!

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.060
Why are you forcing us to take a vacation?

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.370
I'm trying to be nice here!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.870
There is no other motive involved!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.570
There's nothing nice about 
how you're treating us.

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:29.050
Okay! That means you're all going!

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:30.110
Get packed.

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:32.200
Yay. You got a soft side, Pops.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:36.340
Oh, I have one more thing to mention!

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:41.460
There's someone who wants 
to come along on your trip.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:44.460
Well, he won't be that much trouble.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.720
Just keep an eye on him if you would.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:54.730
<b>Please Take Me Skiing</b>

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.990
Hey, look at him! Oh, gosh!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.240
He's so cool!

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.700
He's airborne!

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:15.760
Awesome!

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.410
What? Is he a pro or something?

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:19.700
Damn! Look at that hang time!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.720
He's like a bird!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.470
Er, isn't this getting kind of ridiculous?

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:36.100
We are currently traveling 45 kilometers 
per hour at an altitude of 58 meters.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.980
Our target landing site is 30 meters ahead.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:45.990
<b>Altitude
Distance
Temperature</b>

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.580
Uh, there are people in the 
vicinity of our objective, over.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.150
Get rid of them immediately, over.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:54.030
We've eliminated the intruders,

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.800
but our landing site was 
ravaged by the weapons fire.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.500
I fear that he may trip and fall, over.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:03.450
Uh, flatten the site immediately, over.

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:22.270
I'm glad to see that you're safe.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:25.400
Did you enjoy your first attempt at snowboarding,

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.120
My Lord?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:35.390
It felt good when I jumped and there 
was a rush of air against my crotch.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:36.670
I want to try it again.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:37.460
Understood!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.640
Hey, another crotch rush!

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.660
Bring the helicopter around!

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:51.260
I told you that something didn't sound right.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:55.020
A vacation? Go spread your wings?

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:57.770
We're just babysitting the Shogun.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:02.970
Knowing our lord, he probably said that 
he wanted to sneak out on a ski trip.

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:08.320
The old man didn't know what to 
do, so he just passed it on to us.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:12.690
We won't be getting a 
second of relaxation time.

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:17.040
If anything happens to the Shogun, 
we'll pay with our lives and more.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.950
Still, you've gone a little 
too far, vice chief.

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.060
We're attracting too much attention.

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:22.490
Nobody's supposed to know that we're here.

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:23.590
Don't be stupid.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:26.420
If we let him ski on his own and 
he gets hurt, we're finished.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:30.050
We just have to convince the Shogun 
that this is how people normally ski.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.900
But the other visitors are 
getting scared and leaving.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.070
All the better.

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:37.060
It'll be easier to protect the 
Shogun if nobody else is around.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:41.400
Sogo, bribe a staff member to stop the lift.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.110
Don't let anyone else up there.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:47.540
Hijikata-san, there's someone suspicious 
near the Shogun's landing site.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.820
Someone who's making a huge snowman 
that's going to get in the way.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.350
Tell them to leave.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:54.920
Hey, there.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.680
This is a ski slope.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:58.620
Find somewhere else to play.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.040
Hey, you listening to me?

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.310
Find somewhere else to make your snowman.

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:03.190
Shut up!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.650
This isn't a snowman.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:08.090
This is a Neo Armstrong 
Cyclone Jet Armstrong Cannon.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:09.440
Huh?

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:19.650
Shogun!

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:26.570
Sogo! What's going on?!

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:27.270
Do you read me?!

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:29.280
Is the Shogun safe?!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.280
Where did he go?!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.780
Toshi! Do you read me?!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:34.390
Toshi! We've got big trouble!

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:36.260
I know! I saw the whole thing!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.540
What?! Really?!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.830
I just came across them by coincidence!

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:43.160
I never expected Otae-san and 
Shinpachi-kun to be here!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.870
Huh? What are you talking about?!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.630
It's a good thing that I got 
curious and tailed them!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.840
Hey, what are you talking about?!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:52.210
Don't you know that the Shogun is missing?!

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.190
Huh?! What are you talking about?!

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:57.010
A man wearing nothing but his underwear

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:58.470
just came flying out of the 
sky to attack Otae-san!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.760
That's the Shogun!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:02.520
If I don't do something, Otae-san 
will be... Otae-san will be...!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.270
The Shogun's the one who's getting 
the crap beaten out of him!

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.520
I need to help her at once!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.680
Hey, wait! That's the Shogun!

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:10.890
Damn!

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.650
The snowboard's preventing me from moving!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.150
In that case...

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:16.980
Pervert!

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:19.160
Get away from my Otae-san!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.990
You're the pervert!

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.960
Kondo-san! Shogun!

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.150
This is bad!

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.460
His skis are carrying him away!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.200
Wait a second!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:36.720
The underwear boys are in an 
incredibly wrong position!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.180
Eek! What's that?!

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:42.220
We got a serious case of indecent 
exposure flying down the slope!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.270
Stop them!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:46.550
We can't embarrass the Shogun, the Bakufu!

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.230
Do whatever it takes to stop them!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:52.730
The Shogun and chief 
separated when they jumped!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.450
The Shogun hit an innocent bystander!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.820
Damn, you guys go after Kondo-san!

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:06.310
Leave the Shogun to me!

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:07.740
Chief!

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:09.800
Hey! Are you okay?

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.790
Yeah, I'm just fine.

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:16.800
I'm also a beginner, so I understand 
how your skis can carry you away.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:20.930
Well, let's all be careful.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:24.140
Wait a moment!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.430
That's the Shogun!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.800
Chief! Please stop!

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:29.530
Damn!

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.630
He's going too fast for us to catch up!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:32.770
Huh? Boss?

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.090
Why are you here?

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:34.940
Can you stop the chief...

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.100
Huh? Wait...

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:40.320
Do you realize what you're riding?!

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:42.830
Vice chief!

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:43.690
It's terrible!

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:45.790
The Odd Jobs boss is...

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.710
Wait, vice chief! That's the chief!

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:54.000
Stop!

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.970
Didn't you hear me tell you to 
stop, you wavy-haired punk?!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.750
Huh? Why are you here?

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.370
We don't have time for that!

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.260
Look down! Look down!

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:06.910
Ah! When did that happen?!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.290
Don't give me that shit!

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:10.060
Don't you recognize who that is?!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.120
And who is your board?!

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.450
Ah! When did that happen?

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.770
You're no better than I am!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:17.690
Anyway, stop him as soon as you can!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.700
Or you'll be committing 
seppuku ten times over!

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.910
I would have stopped already if I could!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.170
I'm a beginner at snowboarding,

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:25.160
so how am I supposed to 
know how to stop a human?!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.210
What do I do?!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:29.200
Pretend like we're out in the 
country where it's warm and fuzzy?

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.210
How's that supposed to help?!

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.710
Hey! Wait a moment!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.360
His underwear!

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:36.750
He slows down when I tug on his underwear!

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:40.130
What?! You can control humanboards 
with their underwear?!

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.580
Oh, it's like a brake of sorts!

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:46.730
But we're leaving a strange track.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:48.340
What is this?

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:49.630
It's the track left by the brake.

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:50.530
The brake?!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.730
Where would there be a 
brake on the human body?!

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.780
The penile brake!

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:56.690
When I pull on his underwear,

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:59.190
his penis extends like a brake.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.850
Wait a moment! So you mean this is that?!

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:03.970
It's not actually a brake!

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.420
Cold and hard!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.030
And that's the truth.

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.160
That's not funny! Cut it out!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.970
Stop using that brake!

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:12.250
He won't be able to leave any heirs!

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:14.560
We don't have time to be picky!

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.750
Our priority is to stop this ride!

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.010
We broke the brakes...

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:35.290
Shit! We veered off the trail!

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.940
Stop us! Someone stop us!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:39.890
Gin-san, are you okay?

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:41.150
I'm coming to help!

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:42.610
Hold on!

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.800
Otae, you're here...

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:49.430
Gin-san!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.350
Everything's okay now that we're here!

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:57.670
Why are these siblings acting like 
it's perfectly normal to humanboard?!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.420
I was learning how to snowboard,

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.430
but I accidentally ended up 
riding Shin-chan instead,

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:04.650
and then I discovered the he 
was actually an easier ride.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:06.020
I guess it's because we're siblings!

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:08.430
You're not supposed to use 
a sibling as a snowboard!

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:11.890
I'll teach you how to humanboard.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:12.980
Listen carefully.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:15.440
First, you take note of 
the glasses on your board.

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:17.860
These will serve as the handles.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.790
Sorry! That's impossible!

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:22.440
Please understand that not 
every humanboard wears glasses!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.820
Oh, no! You can't control the 
board if there aren't any glasses!

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.330
Shin-chan!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.120
Uh, that's not Shin-chan!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.370
What do I do?!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.680
I can't do anything now!

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:35.620
Why did you even bother coming out here?!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.130
Hey, I have some advice for you.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:41.030
Have you heard of a penile brake?

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:42.860
The vice chief has snapped!

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:44.790
He's making out-of-character remarks 
that constitute sexual harassment!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.130
He's totally given up!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:48.640
Gin-chan, are you okay?

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:51.210
I'm coming to help you! Hold on!

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.140
You liar!

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:54.520
Clearly you're the one who needs help!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.890
You can't do jack shit!

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:59.340
That's not true!

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.900
I'm going to save everyone!

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.570
We're all going to die...

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:05.730
Huh?! What?!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.770
If you give up, the game is over!

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:13.160
The worst part is when you're still 
clinging to hope when you die.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:16.410
There's someone chiming in 
with really negative remarks!

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:18.060
Don't be fooled!

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:19.460
By your bullshit?

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.160
Hey, what are they doing?!

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:24.180
This is like that whole angel/devil 
whispering in your head thing!

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.980
No. I am not me. I am not you.

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:29.340
But I am me. I am you.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.600
Yes, there is no black or white.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.520
All will return to true darkness!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:37.180
And now it's just a completely black ball!

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:51.030
I've been waiting this whole 
time under the snowball.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.030
Uh, Kagura.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:54.900
Sogo...

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.710
Have you heard of a penile brake?

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:58.780
Huh?

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:00.210
Wait!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:01.910
What are you doing to the leader?!

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:03.380
Wait!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:32.910
Where am I?

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:36.560
I remember that...

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.630
I came to the slopes as a 
bodyguard for the Shogun...

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:51.520
Shogun!

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.600
Where's the Shogun?!

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:57.350
Dammit!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.880
He's not here!

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:00.230
The Shogun isn't here!

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.930
Damn, I need to call for backup!

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:03.350
Out of range?

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.260
Y-You've gotta be kidding...

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:09.190
How far down did we fall?

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.200
No trails.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.550
No sign of civilization.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.950
No help.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:19.450
I just have a bunch of useless incompetents.

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:24.070
We're stranded.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.800
Forget about protecting the Shogun.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.420
We're the ones who've been stranded.

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.720
Shogun!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:35.220
Answer if you're there!

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:38.330
Shogun!

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.000
I'm gonna lose my head.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:50.730
We're all gonna lose our heads.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.270
That's ridiculous.

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:53.860
You get a bunch of innocent 
bystanders involved in your mess,

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.040
and now you want to take our heads?

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:58.280
When we just happened to win a ski trip 
from a drawing in the shopping district?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.490
You fools can go to hell by yourselves.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:04.930
Did you also win a free pass for riding the 
Shogun like a snowboard in that drawing?

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:08.220
Don't ask me. I didn't even 
realize he was under me.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.420
Oh, yeah. That reminds me.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.920
He once mentioned how someone at the top

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.520
needs to understand how 
someone at the bottom feels.

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:18.720
That doesn't mean he should 
become a snowboard.

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:19.910
I see.

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:21.740
So Toshi was using me as a snowboard

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:24.570
because he felt I needed to 
know how the men below me felt.

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:26.100
So that's what it was.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:26.970
It sure was.

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.270
That's why I did it.

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:33.200
In any case, the Shogun can't survive 
this cold in nothing but his underwear.

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:34.280
Uh, lady?

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.900
There are a bunch of men in nothing 
but their underwear right before you.

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:42.070
They say that you're supposed to take off 
your clothes and cuddle to stay warm.

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:44.190
Let's send some naked people to go find him!

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.590
Someone bring me a blankie!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:47.290
A blankie to warm my heart!

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:51.480
Whether we're going to save the 
Shogun or get our heads chopped off,

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:54.320
we need to worry about our own safety first.

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:57.680
I know. We're stranded.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.030
That makes sense.

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:02.320
In that case, we should split 
up into a group for ensuring

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:04.750
our survival and a group 
to search for the Shogun.

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:07.330
Yes, there's no need to worry.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:10.890
The Shogun may be our reviled enemy,

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:15.190
but there's no point in bringing that up now.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:19.930
Let bygones be bygones! Focus 
on the danger we currently face!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.410
I am just an ordinary leader now!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.810
Feel free to dive into my arms!

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:29.280
Well, if something happens to the 
Shogun, we can just blame him.

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:31.030
So what do we do now?

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:32.460
Uh, can you hear me?!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.710
Could you let your leader out of here?!

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:39.500
The other men should have noticed 
that we're all missing.

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:40.580
Help will come eventually.

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.490
Can you hear me?!

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:45.890
So we and the Shogun have 
to survive until then.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.470
We're splitting up into two groups.

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.090
Hey! That was my idea!

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:49.980
You copycat!

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.630
This appears to be a ridge of some sort.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.290
We have a decent view, and it'll be 
easier for others to see us here.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:57.990
Start a fire and keep the 
smoke going at all times.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.950
We'll make this our base.

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:03.650
Try to make some sort of 
shelter from the cold.

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.870
Everyone else will look for the Shogun.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.410
We need to find him today.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.970
Look for the Shogun?

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:12.820
The snow is coming down 
really hard. It's dangerous.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:14.920
That's why we have to go.

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:17.670
We can make it back if we 
have the smoke to guide us.

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.170
But it's too dangerous!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:21.540
What if there are casualties?

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:24.120
Then we'll be fair and use rock, 
paper, scissors to decide.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:24.890
Here we go!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.930
Rock always wins!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.440
Rock, paper...

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:35.360
Good luck!

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:39.410
Kondo-san! Watch your back out there!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:43.700
Uh, there's nothing on 
my back to even watch...

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:45.350
Huh? What?

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:46.200
Did he say something?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.700
Uh, are you forgetting something?

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:51.330
Forgetting something? 
What's he talking about?

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.610
Beats me...

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:54.370
Uh, it's pretty cold...

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:54.810
Uh...

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:55.750
Oh, I know!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.950
The Shogun must be cold!

00:19:57.950 --> 00:20:02.470
I should bring some clothes for him!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.850
Hey, get a grip.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:05.970
There are clothes right there.

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:08.580
Around your waist.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.600
Please, Kondo-san.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.230
You're so forgetful.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:21.560
Oops! I screwed up!

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:23.490
Make sure that they're warm 
before you give them to him.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.790
Th-Then I'll be going...

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:27.990
I just realized that Kondo-san 
isn't wearing anything.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.590
Oh, you're right. I completely forgot.

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:35.840
Hey, everyone. Give Kondo-san 
one article of clothing.

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:38.550
He won't be cold if we all pitch in.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:47.030
Okay. Be careful out there, Kondo-san.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.520
Y-Yeah!

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:53.940
But you all gave me your gloves.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:59.200
Hey, wait.

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:04.030
You'll die if you underestimate the 
bitter cold of a winter mountain.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.820
Wear this.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.360
Ka-Katsura...

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:10.790
As I was saying, we need to 
work together to survive.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.480
We're in an extremely perilous situation.

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:39.480
No help in sight.

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:43.610
Our survival in this unknown land 
rests upon a very fragile trust.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:51.620
Will we be able to survive?

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:00.040
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:37.270
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.340
Damn! Where's the Shogun?!

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:36.810
We're going to die before 
they can chop off our heads!

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:38.490
Next time:

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:44.940
<b>A Vacation in Disorientation</b>

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:40.320
A vacation in disorientation.

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:42.020
Please.

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:50.400
<b>The group divides into two teams for securing shelter and 
finding the Shogun as they attempt to survive in the snowy mountains!!</b>

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:54.950
<b>Stranded in the middle of the 
blizzard, the group encounters...</b>
